# Image-Line

> Image-Line Software is a Belgian music software company, founded in 1994, best known for FL Studio — a complete digital audio workstation (DAW) for Windows and macOS, also known by its original name Fruity Loops. FL Studio comes with free lifetime updates and is rated 4.7/5 by verified users. Image-Line also makes FL Studio Mobile, a DAW for iOS and Android, and FL Cloud: royalty-free sounds, AI-powered mastering, and music distribution integrated into FL Studio.

FL Studio is sold as four one-time-purchase editions (Fruity, Producer, Signature, All Plugins), all with lifetime free updates. A full-featured free trial with no time limit is available; the only trial restriction is that reopening saved projects requires a license.

